Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,YUM!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.31,0:00:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,кажajjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjj
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.35,0:01:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, have you been able to translate all\Nthe text on the winged dragon of Ra yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty close, but for some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.35,0:01:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the network mainframe is still having\Ntrouble with the last few words.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.79,0:01:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can read it. You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That Egyptian text is\Ncompletely clear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can read that paragraph as\Nif it were written in English.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've never seen that\Nlanguage before in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's written in an ancient text.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.79,0:01:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,One that was used by high-ranking\Nindividuals in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,On the left is a sorcerer\Nfighting against the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.41,0:01:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's you, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you still have any\Ndoubt, look at his monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.33,0:01:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the blue-eyes white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.03,0:01:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's toying with my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.95,0:01:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not some ancient magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the president of Kaiba Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.13,0:01:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.71,0:02:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.01,0:02:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,These Egyptian myths are\Nbeginning to affect my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.75,0:02:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.83,0:02:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Route 1 of the Battle City\NFinals is now complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The four remaining finalists are\NYugi, Joey, Kaiba, and Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The competition will resume tomorrow\Nwhen we land at our next dueling site.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.77,0:02:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we're not dueling\Non the blip anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, I was getting ass sick anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.35,0:02:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I used up three boff bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the important thing is that\Nwe both made it to the next round.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.06,0:02:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So look out, Kaiba and Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.41,0:02:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we come. Aw, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Duelist Kingdom all over again. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you have got some\Nserious resting to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This tournament's been\Npretty intense so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.51,0:02:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it, Uke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it can't get much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.67,0:02:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bacora and Odeon are knocked out,\Nand Mai's in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all because of\NMerrick and his evil plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.25,0:02:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll stop that creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's check up on Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about what\Nhappened to your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,May I pay her a visit with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.05,0:03:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Serenity. How's Mai? Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get her mind back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.11,0:03:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, has she said a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.93,0:03:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I let you\Ndown, but mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.01,0:03:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you'll get your\Nrevenge against that, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joey? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that anger and\Nrevenge will only make things worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just how Mai got this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.89,0:03:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick is so full of\Nanger and hate that he
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.35,0:03:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,gets pleasure from watching\Nother people suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,When I took my bandages off,\Nthis is not what I wanted to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.05,0:03:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, it'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sis. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.95,0:03:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There is hope ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.83,0:04:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,For where there is evil,\Nthere is also good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick was good once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He began life as an innocent\Nchild like everyone does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But that innocence disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.55,0:04:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving my brother with a dark\Nhole where his heart once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.23,0:04:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember when this evil was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.59,0:04:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened on the night Merrick\Nreceived the Tomb Keeper's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,initiation and inherited the task\Nof protecting the Pharaoh's tomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A task he always resented.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.13,0:04:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this dark presence has completely\Ntaken over my brother's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu, what happens if there's\Nno way to save your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It may be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.51,0:04:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it was my destiny to\Nsave the world from destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that meant\Ndefeating your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And putting an end to\Nhis plan, not saving him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's caused enough damage already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick must be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.49,0:04:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's got a point, Dishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's too late to save Marek\Nfrom the evil that's inside him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:05:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you gotta admit, the\Nguy's about as nasty as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's hard to imagine\Nhim ever being nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You must trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.05,0:05:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there is hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.09,0:05:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still much you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't that long ago\Nthat my brother Marek
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,began to lose his way and\Nturn toward the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,For generations, my family\Nhas lived in secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,deep beneath the desert sands,\Nwatching over the tomb of the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,For 5,000 years, an Ishtar has stood\Nguard, waiting for Pharaoh to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As the firstborn Ishtar's son,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick was required to\Nbear the Pharaoh's secret
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,on his back and forbidden\Nto ever leave the tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.57,0:05:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.95,0:05:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, you have to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.89,0:05:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop worrying. It's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.87,0:05:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Father's asleep by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised you'd take\Nme outside one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't we go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.31,0:05:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If Father finds out, we'll\Nboth be in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:06:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know the code\Nof the Tomb Keepers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.63,0:06:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The outside world's off limits to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon will cover for us and Father will\Nnever suspect a thing. Right? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.75,0:06:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live like a\Nnormal person for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.33,0:06:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.03,0:06:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will ever know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.35,0:06:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this one time, Miss Shizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.49,0:06:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a little curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.55,0:06:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Shizu, I promise I'll\Ntake care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.19,0:06:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my duty to ensure that\NMaster Merrick is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.57,0:06:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.11,0:06:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.81,0:06:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's that important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But promise me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,After one hour, we'll return home and\Nnever speak of this again. I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I can see how\Nthe surface dwellers live!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:07:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now remember, Merrick, one\Nhour and then we return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And no one must ever know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.09,0:07:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we were violating\Nour family's code.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I also knew that\NMerrick deserved to see the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,light of the outside world\Nat least once in his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize that his exposure to this
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,light would cause the\Ndarkness within him to grow
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.89,0:07:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, slow down, brother\NI told you to stay by my side
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.77,0:07:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, just look at all these people I\Nnever dreamed it looked like this Merrick,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not our world, so don't grow\Ntoo attached. Don't worry, Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.43,0:07:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.41,0:07:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not right. Books should\Nnever be just thrown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.11,0:07:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this isn't like my\Nscriptures at all This is fun
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.57,0:08:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like that before.\NSorry, but I'm a loner, Daddy. A rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The man inside that glass\Nbox has one of these machines
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.27,0:08:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, have you never seen a TV before?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.39,0:08:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, let's go. You're impossible.\NThe Shizu, what was in that glass box?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.03,0:08:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, TV Well, what was that strange\Nmachine I saw inside the TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.15,0:08:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A motorcycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to ride one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But as long as I'm a tomb keeper,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never be able to ride on\Na motorcycle or watch a TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to get Merrick home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.63,0:08:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd already seen too much. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.05,0:08:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, our time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.45,0:09:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised you'd obey, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.47,0:09:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I bring home the picture\Nof the motorcycle for my book?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.17,0:09:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, if Father finds\Nit, we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.09,0:09:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just one picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.85,0:09:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you can take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But promise me that you'll\Nhide it when we get back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.39,0:09:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.45,0:09:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh will soon return to this\Nworld. Prepare for him. Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready yourselves right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.69,0:09:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lives and your\Ndestinies depend on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.65,0:09:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I must warn you, if you\Nreject your sacred duty,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the future will bring nothing but tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I had made a great mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,As the keepers of the Pharaoh's tomb,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.35,0:10:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,we were forbidden to see the world,\Nand I was beginning to understand why.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.31,0:10:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to pay the\Nprice for my actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I exposed Merrick to a world\Nhe should never have seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and this caused Merrick to reject\Nour family, and his evil side grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What did this stranger mean\Nwhen he warned us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.95,0:10:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that guy come from, and how did\Nhe know we're waiting for the Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.81,0:10:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, you mustn't speak\Nof the Pharaoh right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.57,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.83,0:10:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We never should have come up here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget all that you\Nsaw, forget about the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.97,0:10:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,stranger and let's go\Nhome but now that he had
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,seen the outside world\Nforgetting it was an
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,impossible task why do we\Nhave to go back down into
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,the darkness merrick\Nit's just not our choice
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.97,0:10:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,just give me one minute\Nsis what do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you're doing merrick\Nsomeday i'll ride one of
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:11:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,these i'll ride right\Nout of the darkness below
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ride away forever, and no one\Nwill be able to stop me, not my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,not some stupid pharaoh No one,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finally be free. And\NI'll control my own destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.89,0:11:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you can't wait\Nfarther. What's that thing, sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Right up there
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.95,0:11:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of alarm. I must\Nnot have seen it in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.09,0:11:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no Sister, tell me what's going on\NIs father going to be angry with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get back to our bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.03,0:11:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon But my father had already\Nweakened him with the Millennium Rod
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.67,0:12:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Marek, I'm sorry I failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.69,0:12:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, you were supposed to protect Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.49,0:12:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to leave and never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek, Ishizu, how dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.81,0:12:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you are forbidden\Nto walk with the outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.53,0:12:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Odeon must pay for your\Ndisobedience by leaving us forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That decision is final.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop laughing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me anymore. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.95,0:12:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.11,0:12:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, these items are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.97,0:12:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, you shall inherit\Nthose when the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And no sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.55,0:12:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you keep quiet, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm making my own rules now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you to put that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.89,0:12:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I don't, Merrick, drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.71,0:13:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, stop this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't concern you, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.19,0:13:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.99,0:13:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, father, time to\Nsend you to the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The future is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to destroy my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You need me to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.31,0:13:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, but what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right now, wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.11,0:13:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The stranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.75,0:13:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You have taken your first step, Marek,\Non a dangerous path of ultimate darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:14:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you must turn back\Nbefore it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.97,0:14:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the pharaoh will return. Turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like Marek's anger and\Njealousy fed the evil inside him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.36,0:14:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to feel bad for that spoiled
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,brat because he grew\Ninto some evil nutcase?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, your brother trapped\NMai's mind in the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.55,0:14:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now she's living out her worst nightmares,\Nand I'm gonna make sure he pays!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,it is possible to destroy the evil within\Nmy brother without destroying the good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize now that destinies\Ncan be changed. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,As the Pharaoh's vessel,\Nyou have the power to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention, I'll do this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.65,0:14:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lights out in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to crash in Joey's suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What you talking about, Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.37,0:14:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:14:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your room's like a palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never even know that I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.43,0:15:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll know by the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.41,0:15:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, sweet dreams.\NYou too. Get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, we got a big day ahead, so\Nlet's get us some shut-eye. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Odds are that one of us\Nwill have to duel Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.23,0:15:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's a butt-kicking\Nwe'll need to be rested for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Joey? Question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know you and\NYugi won't be dueling each
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.05,0:15:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,other in the semifinals\Ninstead of dueling Marek?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.85,0:15:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch what you say, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna jinx us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, there is one more thing\NI must give to you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a powerful object that I no longer\Nhave any use for. Thanks? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate chose me to wear\Nthe Millennium Necklace,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.89,0:15:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but it is time I passed\Nits magic to the one
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.87,0:15:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,who is destined to rescue\Nthe world from despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, it no longer shows\Nme the future, Yugi. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have completed my mission,\Nand now it is your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, we should head back to\Nthe room before lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.41,0:16:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,See you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Try and get some sleep.\NGood night. Sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.11,0:16:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have two Millennium Miners.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.57,0:16:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll need them both\Nto put an end to Marek's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.01,0:16:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.43,0:16:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.69,0:16:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If Yugi defeats the\NDark Force inside Marek,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.55,0:16:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,does that mean the world\Nwill be safe from danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is there another\Nevil out there somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.34,0:16:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi now possesses the\Npower to discover these answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.81,0:16:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be discarded that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That fiend may have taken over my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.25,0:16:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but a portion of my spirit\Nremains within you, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.89,0:17:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the Millennium Ring to deliver\Nmy spirit into Bakura as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the Battle City Finals end tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.75,0:17:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you must sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.83,0:17:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's natural for you to be frightened,\Nbut together we can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.29,0:17:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like things have\Ngotten so far out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.39,0:17:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when I think I have\NMerrick all figured out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,he goes and becomes 20 times more\Nevil than he was in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.81,0:17:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to believe that,\Nbut I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw what he did to Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.41,0:17:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,this guy's completely insane\Nand I'm the one he really
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,wants let me guess if we trust\Nin the heart of the cards
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.35,0:17:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,we can beat this guy yes but\Nthis is so much more than
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,just a card game and I don't\Nwant to lose any more friends
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.37,0:17:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,this madness has to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Odeon, it's time to do what I\Nshould have done ages ago in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.95,0:18:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,order for me to survive you'll\Nhave to be sent to the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.71,0:18:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'll have to step in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.41,0:18:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The spirit of the Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're half right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got company with me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The real Marek is here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears the essence of my weaker self\Nhas taken refuge within the body of Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.77,0:18:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And I brought an old friend\Nalong to help me get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.71,0:18:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He promised me the Millennium Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.35,0:18:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can successfully do away with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.85,0:18:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the fool who's trying to\Ncollect the Millennium Items.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hand over the rod,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.53,0:18:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't force me to add you to my\Nother collection, Merrick. My victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Rod can easily\Noverpower your pitiful ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you you were no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish you off once\NI take care of Oneon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.01,0:19:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.07,0:19:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now just hand over the object.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.69,0:19:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to me that the\Npower of our items is equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.47,0:19:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you'd like to\Nduel me for the rights
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,to the Millennium Raw\Nif you can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we raise the stakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.71,0:19:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The winning duelist will\Nkeep the millennia broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.11,0:19:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The loser will be banished\Nto the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Draw your cards and let\Nthe Shadow Game begin.
